# Keep the Agent Engine / Cloud Run upload small (payload limit is 8 MB for Agent Engine).
# Exclude local envs, caches, VCS, generated media, and site/blog assets.
.git/
.venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.adk/
**/*.pyc
# regenerable media + data (never needed in the deployed package)
generated/
**/generated/
movie/data/
transcripts/
# docs / blog / large static assets (not part of the agent runtime)
docs/
blog/
assets/
*.zip
# node
node_modules/
